    "description": "This dataset contains description of measurements taken by multi-beam sounder and bottom corers from the research vessel Pourquoi Pas? as part of the CASEIS cruise in the Caribbean Sea from 2016-05-28 to 2016-07-04. The objective of the CASEIS marine cruise was to perform a submarine paleo-seismological study to decipher the earthquake history along the Lesser Antilles subduction area. This is U.S State Department Marine Scientific Research (MSR) Research Application Tracking System (RATS) cruise U2016-010. Cruise report is in PDF.",
